cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pynem, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "pynem: Neighborhood EM for spatial clustering on graphs"
abstract: >-
  pynem is a standalone Python implementation of the Neighborhood EM (NEM)
  algorithm — clustering that combines the EM algorithm with a hidden Markov
  random field. It faithfully reproduces the PPanGGOLiN pangenome-partitioning
  pipeline and adds per-variable weighting (genome redundancy) and a MAG-aware
  completeness model (genome incompleteness).
